3. **ASan preset.** The last ASan pass predates the fixture change. It was not re-run after the test-only edit.

Nothing here can be closed from this environment. I appended a short re-check entry to `.ralph-tui/progress.md` recording that the tree is unchanged and the two blockers are still open. Finishing the story needs a native Linux Vulkan host and the bench target from US-074.
